Z||000009||sluppy123||02-13-2001||06:45 PM||||Here's some pics of my sub box, with a 8" sub. I made mine just as Stimpy did, but with a few differances in materials. <BR>I started with a piece of plywood cut to fit the opening in the footwell. Then I used some plain cardboard and duct tape to create the back of the box. Using the trial and error approach I formed it until it fit. I then figerglassed the entire box, leaving the cardboard under the fiberglass.<P> <IMG SRC="http://albums.photopoint.com/j/View?u=247832&a=11172186&p=40895028&Sequence=0"> <P> <IMG SRC="http://albums.photopoint.com/j/View?u=247832&a=11172186&p=40895680&Sequence=0"> <P> <IMG SRC="http://albums.photopoint.com/j/View?u=247832&a=11172186&p=39145017&Sequence=0"> <P>------------------<BR>-Brian, Toolmaker<BR>Lincoln, NE<BR>85' SC & 87' GT-Leather, Lowered, Nitrous<BR>   <IMG SRC="http://albums.photopoint.com/j/View?u=247832&a=7653930&p=37756786&Sequence=0"> ||||reg||10
